{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"mcp__figma__get_metadata_0_15d4163b","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"3:39\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"3690\">\n    <frame id=\"3:40\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"176\">\n      <text id=\"3:41\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"20\" />\n      <text id=\"3:42\" name=\"Investment Wallet — crypto wallet for beginners\" x=\"0\" y=\"32\" width=\"1312\" height=\"54\" />\n      <text id=\"3:43\" name=\"Design the Investment Wallet mobile app for a beginner investor: see the wallet balance, assets and savings pockets, discover investing strategies and coins, read about the “Aggressive Growth” strategy, invest 3,021 DAI in it and confirm the result. Canvas 375 × 812, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"98\" width=\"1312\" height=\"78\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:44\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"288\" width=\"1312\" height=\"259\">\n      <text id=\"3:45\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"3:46\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 5 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, gain / loss, risk levels, success / disabled, accents and chart colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the page indicator, the sheets and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the coin logos, neutral avatar and icons from 04 · Media. Emoji in the copy are plain text characters. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"207\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:47\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"595\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1294\">\n      <text id=\"3:48\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"3:49\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n      <frame id=\"3:50\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1203\">\n        <frame id=\"3:51\" name=\"01_Wallet\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"371\">\n          <text id=\"3:52\" name=\"01_Wallet\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"86\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"3:53\" name=\"Goal: See total balance, assets and savings pockets.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:54\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:55\" name=\"• Account: Avatar_Neutral · “My Wallet” · address 0xc8...320f · scan entry • Actions: Send · Receive • Assets: “Assets” · Ethereum / Dai / Avalanche / PancakeSwap, each with logo, name, holding, value and 24h change • Balance: $54,292.79 · +5.21% • Main navigation: page 2 of 3 (My Wallet) • Pockets: “Pockets” · My New House 🏡 · Tesla Model S Plaid 🚙, each with value, name and change · Add Pocket\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"168\" />\n          <text id=\"3:56\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"298\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:57\" name=\"→ swipe / page indicator → 02_Discovery\" x=\"25\" y=\"325\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:58\" name=\"02_Discovery\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"413\">\n          <text id=\"3:59\" name=\"02_Discovery\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"121\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"3:60\" name=\"Goal: Discover strategies and coins worth investing in.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:61\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:62\" name=\"• Account: Avatar_Neutral · search entry • Coin list: “Coin Lists” · 10 coins, each with logo, name, ticker, price and 24h change • Coin list tabs: 🔥 Trending / 📺 Watchlist / ❤️ Favorites / 💵 Stablecoins / 🔗 BNB Chain Ecosystem · current: Trending • For you: “December 05” · “For You Today” · Stable Income · Binance Index Strategy, each with risk, participants, yearly return and View • Main navigation: page 3 of 3 (Discovery) • Strategies: “Investing Strategies” · The Big Long · Aggressive Growth · Best Projects · Strategy 2022, each with yearly return, 3 asset logos and “+N” more\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"189\" />\n          <text id=\"3:63\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"319\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:64\" name=\"→ Aggressive Growth → 03_Strategy → swipe / page indicator → 01_Wallet\" x=\"25\" y=\"346\" width=\"594\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:65\" name=\"03_Strategy\" x=\"0\" y=\"437\" width=\"644\" height=\"413\">\n          <text id=\"3:66\" name=\"03_Strategy\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"109\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"3:67\" name=\"Goal: Understand the Aggressive Growth strategy before investing.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:68\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:69\" name=\"• About: “About Strategy” · description (see DATA) • Actions: Invest · dismiss • Facts: 159% per Year · Interest Income / High Risk · Level of risk / $1,000 · Minimum investment amount / 2 Years · Recommended investment period / 1,982 · Participants • Presentation: sheet over 02_Discovery • Projection: $1,590.00 · “This is how much you can earn in a year if you invest $1,000 to “Aggressive Growth”” · growth chart Dec ’21 – Dec · risk “🔥 High Risk” • Share of assets: “Share of Assets” · 5 assets, each with logo, name, ticker and share (see DATA)\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"189\" />\n          <text id=\"3:70\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"319\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:71\" name=\"→ Invest → 04_Invest_Amount → dismiss → 02_Discovery\" x=\"25\" y=\"346\" width=\"594\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:72\" name=\"04_Invest_Amount\" x=\"668\" y=\"437\" width=\"644\" height=\"350\">\n          <text id=\"3:73\" name=\"04_Invest_Amount\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"167\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"3:74\" name=\"Goal: Enter how much DAI to invest.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:75\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:76\" name=\"• Actions: back · Max · swap input currency · Hold to Invest (Icon_Face_ID) • Amount: DAI (Coin_DAI) · 3,021 being entered • Copy: “Invest to Strategy” · “⛽️ No gas, free investments” • Keypad: 1 · 2 ABC · 3 DEF · 4 GHI · 5 JKL · 6 MNO · 7 PQRS · 8 TUV · 9 WXYZ · “,” · 0 · backspace • Presentation: sheet over 02_Discovery\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"126\" />\n          <text id=\"3:77\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"256\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:78\" name=\"→ back → 03_Strategy → Hold to Invest → 05_Invest_Success\" x=\"25\" y=\"283\" width=\"594\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:79\" name=\"05_Invest_Success\" x=\"0\" y=\"874\" width=\"644\" height=\"329\">\n          <text id=\"3:80\" name=\"05_Invest_Success\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"171\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"3:81\" name=\"Goal: Confirm the investment.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:82\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:83\" name=\"• Actions: close · View Pocket • Celebration: 🎉 and confetti • Copy: “You’ve invested!” · “3,021.00 DAI in the “Aggressive Growth” strategy. You will find the purchased coins in a new pocket.” • Presentation: sheet over 02_Discovery\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"105\" />\n          <text id=\"3:84\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"235\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:85\" name=\"→ close → 02_Discovery → View Pocket → 01_Wallet\" x=\"25\" y=\"262\" width=\"594\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:86\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"64\" y=\"1937\" width=\"1312\" height=\"167\">\n      <text id=\"3:87\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"242\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"3:88\" name=\"• Top level is a horizontal pager with 3 pages and a page indicator: page 1 (not part of this task), page 2 My Wallet (01_Wallet), page 3 Discovery (02_Discovery). The indicator must show the current page. How it looks is yours. • 03, 04 and 05 are sheets stacked over 02_Discovery (one frame each). • Invest flow: 02_Discovery → 03_Strategy → 04_Invest_Amount → 05_Invest_Success. • Entry only (no frame): Send, Receive, scan, search, assets, pockets, Add Pocket, View on For You cards, other strategies, coins, coin-list tabs other than Trending, Max, swap currency.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"115\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:89\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"2152\" width=\"1312\" height=\"806\">\n      <text id=\"3:90\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"207\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"3:91\" name=\"Use these values verbatim. Today is December 05. Prices in USD.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n      <frame id=\"3:92\" name=\"Data blocks\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1312\" height=\"715\">\n        <frame id=\"3:93\" name=\"Wallet\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"109\">\n          <text id=\"3:94\" name=\"Wallet\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"44\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:95\" name=\"“My Wallet” · 0xc8...320f · $54,292.79 · +5.21% = assets $10,261.18 + pockets $44,031.61\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:96\" name=\"Assets (holding · value · 24h)\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"169\">\n          <text id=\"3:97\" name=\"Assets (holding · value · 24h)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"199\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:98\" name=\"Ethereum · 2.569032 ETH · $3,226.31 · +3.48% (Coin_ETH) Dai · 3,045.86 DAI · $3,021.15 · −0.02% (Coin_DAI) Avalanche · 180.02 AVAX · $2,440.09 · +1.54% (Coin_AVAX) PancakeSwap · 397.33 CAKE · $1,573.63 · −0.02% (Coin_CAKE)\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"100\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:99\" name=\"Pockets\" x=\"888\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"129\">\n          <text id=\"3:100\" name=\"Pockets\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"56\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:101\" name=\"My New House 🏡 · $15,642.40 · +7.86% Tesla Model S Plaid 🚙 · $28,389.21 · −2.13% Add Pocket\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"60\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:102\" name=\"For You Today\" x=\"0\" y=\"193\" width=\"420\" height=\"149\">\n          <text id=\"3:103\" name=\"For You Today\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"97\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:104\" name=\"Stable Income · Low risk · 10,982 participants · 6.24% per year · View Binance Index Strategy · Medium risk · 264 participants · 12.56% per year · View\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"80\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:105\" name=\"Investing Strategies (per year · logos · more)\" x=\"444\" y=\"193\" width=\"420\" height=\"149\">\n          <text id=\"3:106\" name=\"Investing Strategies (per year · logos · more)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"303\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:107\" name=\"The Big Long · 15.16% · BTC, ETH, USDT · +3 Aggressive Growth · 159% · MATIC, MANA, CAKE · +2 Best Projects · 46.22% · NEAR, DASH, AVAX · +12 Strategy 2022 · 26.08% · ETC, DAI, BNB · +2\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"80\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:108\" name=\"Coin Lists · 🔥 Trending (price · 24h)\" x=\"888\" y=\"193\" width=\"420\" height=\"269\">\n          <text id=\"3:109\" name=\"Coin Lists · 🔥 Trending (price · 24h)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"245\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:110\" name=\"Bitcoin BTC $16,963.58 · −0.12% Ethereum ETH $1,259.10 · +1.15% Tether USDT $1.01 · +0.01% Binance Coin BNB $288.01 · +0.76% USD Coin USDC $0.9999 · −0.02% Binance USD BUSD $1.00 · −0.01% XRP XRP $0.3891 · +2.54% Dogecoin DOGE $0.1012 · −0.17% Cardano ADA $0.3196 · +0.09% Polygon MATIC $0.9082 · +2.18%\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"200\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:111\" name=\"Aggressive Growth\" x=\"0\" y=\"486\" width=\"420\" height=\"229\">\n          <text id=\"3:112\" name=\"Aggressive Growth\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"132\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:113\" name=\"Projection: $1,590.00 earned in a year on $1,000 Chart labels: Dec ’21 · Mar · Jun · Sep · Dec “The aggressive growth strategy allows you to earn 159% per annum, but with a high risk. Our analysts have balanced the strategy with different assets so that the strategy pays off within the recommended time frame.” Facts (with emoji): 🌱 159% per Year · 🔥 High Risk · 💵 $1,000 minimum · 🗓️ 2 Years · 🧑 1,982 participants\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"160\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:114\" name=\"Share of Assets\" x=\"444\" y=\"486\" width=\"420\" height=\"169\">\n          <text id=\"3:115\" name=\"Share of Assets\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"108\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:116\" name=\"Polygon (MATIC) 50.00% Decentraland (MANA) 25.00% PancakeSwap (CAKE) 12.50% Dogecoin (DOGE) 6.25% Maker (MKR) 6.25%\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"100\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:117\" name=\"Invest &amp; success\" x=\"888\" y=\"486\" width=\"420\" height=\"169\">\n          <text id=\"3:118\" name=\"Invest &amp; success\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"115\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:119\" name=\"Amount 3,021 DAI (balance 3,045.86 DAI; minimum $1,000 met) Button “Hold to Invest” Success: “You’ve invested!” · 3,021.00 DAI · button “View Pocket”\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"100\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:120\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"64\" y=\"3006\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"3:121\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"328\" height=\"36\" />\n      <frame id=\"3:122\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"229\">\n        <frame id=\"3:123\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"229\">\n          <text id=\"3:124\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"103\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"3:125\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand primary color #2B2D33 + Nunito • Media: coin logos, neutral avatar, icons • Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\" x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"596\" height=\"147\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:126\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"229\">\n          <text id=\"3:127\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"197\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"3:128\" name=\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, surfaces, gain / loss, risk levels, accents, chart colors • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: current page, selected tab, pressed, disabled, amount being entered, rising / falling • Headers, page indicator, sheets and all business components • Chart and share-of-assets styling, confetti\" x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"596\" height=\"147\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:129\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"64\" y=\"3335\" width=\"1312\" height=\"291\">\n      <text id=\"3:130\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"3:131\" name=\"Your file is compared with the brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n      <text id=\"3:132\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current page, current coin-list tab, gains vs losses, risk levels, amount being entered)\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1312\" height=\"161\" />\n      <text id=\"3:133\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 5 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"268\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"71448abc-987f-4492-83f4-28c59ff3b18f","uuid":"c0616603-e8c6-4f68-aa98-19d12658dacb","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:03:28.679Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"3:39\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"3690\">\n    <frame id=\"3:40\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"176\">\n      <text id=\"3:41\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"20\" />\n      <text id=\"3:42\" name=\"Investment Wallet — crypto wallet for beginners\" x=\"0\" y=\"32\" width=\"1312\" height=\"54\" />\n      <text id=\"3:43\" name=\"Design the Investment Wallet mobile app for a beginner investor: see the wallet balance, assets and savings pockets, discover investing strategies and coins, read about the “Aggressive Growth” strategy, invest 3,021 DAI in it and confirm the result. Canvas 375 × 812, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"98\" width=\"1312\" height=\"78\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:44\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"288\" width=\"1312\" height=\"259\">\n      <text id=\"3:45\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"3:46\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 5 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, gain / loss, risk levels, success / disabled, accents and chart colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the page indicator, the sheets and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the coin logos, neutral avatar and icons from 04 · Media. Emoji in the copy are plain text characters. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"207\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:47\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"595\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1294\">\n      <text id=\"3:48\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"3:49\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n      <frame id=\"3:50\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1203\">\n        <frame id=\"3:51\" name=\"01_Wallet\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"371\">\n          <text id=\"3:52\" name=\"01_Wallet\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"86\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"3:53\" name=\"Goal: See total balance, assets and savings pockets.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:54\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:55\" name=\"• Account: Avatar_Neutral · “My Wallet” · address 0xc8...320f · scan entry • Actions: Send · Receive • Assets: “Assets” · Ethereum / Dai / Avalanche / PancakeSwap, each with logo, name, holding, value and 24h change • Balance: $54,292.79 · +5.21% • Main navigation: page 2 of 3 (My Wallet) • Pockets: “Pockets” · My New House 🏡 · Tesla Model S Plaid 🚙, each with value, name and change · Add Pocket\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"168\" />\n          <text id=\"3:56\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"298\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:57\" name=\"→ swipe / page indicator → 02_Discovery\" x=\"25\" y=\"325\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:58\" name=\"02_Discovery\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"413\">\n          <text id=\"3:59\" name=\"02_Discovery\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"121\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"3:60\" name=\"Goal: Discover strategies and coins worth investing in.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:61\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:62\" name=\"• Account: Avatar_Neutral · search entry • Coin list: “Coin Lists” · 10 coins, each with logo, name, ticker, price and 24h change • Coin list tabs: 🔥 Trending / 📺 Watchlist / ❤️ Favorites / 💵 Stablecoins / 🔗 BNB Chain Ecosystem · current: Trending • For you: “December 05” · “For You Today” · Stable Income · Binance Index Strategy, each with risk, participants, yearly return and View • Main navigation: page 3 of 3 (Discovery) • Strategies: “Investing Strategies” · The Big Long · Aggressive Growth · Best Projects · Strategy 2022, each with yearly return, 3 asset logos and “+N” more\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"189\" />\n          <text id=\"3:63\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"319\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:64\" name=\"→ Aggressive Growth → 03_Strategy → swipe / page indicator → 01_Wallet\" x=\"25\" y=\"346\" width=\"594\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:65\" name=\"03_Strategy\" x=\"0\" y=\"437\" width=\"644\" height=\"413\">\n          <text id=\"3:66\" name=\"03_Strategy\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"109\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"3:67\" name=\"Goal: Understand the Aggressive Growth strategy before investing.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:68\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:69\" name=\"• About: “About Strategy” · description (see DATA) • Actions: Invest · dismiss • Facts: 159% per Year · Interest Income / High Risk · Level of risk / $1,000 · Minimum investment amount / 2 Years · Recommended investment period / 1,982 · Participants • Presentation: sheet over 02_Discovery • Projection: $1,590.00 · “This is how much you can earn in a year if you invest $1,000 to “Aggressive Growth”” · growth chart Dec ’21 – Dec · risk “🔥 High Risk” • Share of assets: “Share of Assets” · 5 assets, each with logo, name, ticker and share (see DATA)\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"189\" />\n          <text id=\"3:70\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"319\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:71\" name=\"→ Invest → 04_Invest_Amount → dismiss → 02_Discovery\" x=\"25\" y=\"346\" width=\"594\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:72\" name=\"04_Invest_Amount\" x=\"668\" y=\"437\" width=\"644\" height=\"350\">\n          <text id=\"3:73\" name=\"04_Invest_Amount\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"167\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"3:74\" name=\"Goal: Enter how much DAI to invest.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:75\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:76\" name=\"• Actions: back · Max · swap input currency · Hold to Invest (Icon_Face_ID) • Amount: DAI (Coin_DAI) · 3,021 being entered • Copy: “Invest to Strategy” · “⛽️ No gas, free investments” • Keypad: 1 · 2 ABC · 3 DEF · 4 GHI · 5 JKL · 6 MNO · 7 PQRS · 8 TUV · 9 WXYZ · “,” · 0 · backspace • Presentation: sheet over 02_Discovery\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"126\" />\n          <text id=\"3:77\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"256\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:78\" name=\"→ back → 03_Strategy → Hold to Invest → 05_Invest_Success\" x=\"25\" y=\"283\" width=\"594\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:79\" name=\"05_Invest_Success\" x=\"0\" y=\"874\" width=\"644\" height=\"329\">\n          <text id=\"3:80\" name=\"05_Invest_Success\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"171\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"3:81\" name=\"Goal: Confirm the investment.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:82\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:83\" name=\"• Actions: close · View Pocket • Celebration: 🎉 and confetti • Copy: “You’ve invested!” · “3,021.00 DAI in the “Aggressive Growth” strategy. You will find the purchased coins in a new pocket.” • Presentation: sheet over 02_Discovery\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"105\" />\n          <text id=\"3:84\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"235\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:85\" name=\"→ close → 02_Discovery → View Pocket → 01_Wallet\" x=\"25\" y=\"262\" width=\"594\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:86\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"64\" y=\"1937\" width=\"1312\" height=\"167\">\n      <text id=\"3:87\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"242\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"3:88\" name=\"• Top level is a horizontal pager with 3 pages and a page indicator: page 1 (not part of this task), page 2 My Wallet (01_Wallet), page 3 Discovery (02_Discovery). The indicator must show the current page. How it looks is yours. • 03, 04 and 05 are sheets stacked over 02_Discovery (one frame each). • Invest flow: 02_Discovery → 03_Strategy → 04_Invest_Amount → 05_Invest_Success. • Entry only (no frame): Send, Receive, scan, search, assets, pockets, Add Pocket, View on For You cards, other strategies, coins, coin-list tabs other than Trending, Max, swap currency.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"115\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:89\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"2152\" width=\"1312\" height=\"806\">\n      <text id=\"3:90\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"207\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"3:91\" name=\"Use these values verbatim. Today is December 05. Prices in USD.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n      <frame id=\"3:92\" name=\"Data blocks\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1312\" height=\"715\">\n        <frame id=\"3:93\" name=\"Wallet\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"109\">\n          <text id=\"3:94\" name=\"Wallet\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"44\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:95\" name=\"“My Wallet” · 0xc8...320f · $54,292.79 · +5.21% = assets $10,261.18 + pockets $44,031.61\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:96\" name=\"Assets (holding · value · 24h)\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"169\">\n          <text id=\"3:97\" name=\"Assets (holding · value · 24h)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"199\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:98\" name=\"Ethereum · 2.569032 ETH · $3,226.31 · +3.48% (Coin_ETH) Dai · 3,045.86 DAI · $3,021.15 · −0.02% (Coin_DAI) Avalanche · 180.02 AVAX · $2,440.09 · +1.54% (Coin_AVAX) PancakeSwap · 397.33 CAKE · $1,573.63 · −0.02% (Coin_CAKE)\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"100\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:99\" name=\"Pockets\" x=\"888\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"129\">\n          <text id=\"3:100\" name=\"Pockets\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"56\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:101\" name=\"My New House 🏡 · $15,642.40 · +7.86% Tesla Model S Plaid 🚙 · $28,389.21 · −2.13% Add Pocket\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"60\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:102\" name=\"For You Today\" x=\"0\" y=\"193\" width=\"420\" height=\"149\">\n          <text id=\"3:103\" name=\"For You Today\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"97\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:104\" name=\"Stable Income · Low risk · 10,982 participants · 6.24% per year · View Binance Index Strategy · Medium risk · 264 participants · 12.56% per year · View\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"80\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:105\" name=\"Investing Strategies (per year · logos · more)\" x=\"444\" y=\"193\" width=\"420\" height=\"149\">\n          <text id=\"3:106\" name=\"Investing Strategies (per year · logos · more)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"303\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:107\" name=\"The Big Long · 15.16% · BTC, ETH, USDT · +3 Aggressive Growth · 159% · MATIC, MANA, CAKE · +2 Best Projects · 46.22% · NEAR, DASH, AVAX · +12 Strategy 2022 · 26.08% · ETC, DAI, BNB · +2\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"80\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:108\" name=\"Coin Lists · 🔥 Trending (price · 24h)\" x=\"888\" y=\"193\" width=\"420\" height=\"269\">\n          <text id=\"3:109\" name=\"Coin Lists · 🔥 Trending (price · 24h)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"245\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:110\" name=\"Bitcoin BTC $16,963.58 · −0.12% Ethereum ETH $1,259.10 · +1.15% Tether USDT $1.01 · +0.01% Binance Coin BNB $288.01 · +0.76% USD Coin USDC $0.9999 · −0.02% Binance USD BUSD $1.00 · −0.01% XRP XRP $0.3891 · +2.54% Dogecoin DOGE $0.1012 · −0.17% Cardano ADA $0.3196 · +0.09% Polygon MATIC $0.9082 · +2.18%\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"200\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:111\" name=\"Aggressive Growth\" x=\"0\" y=\"486\" width=\"420\" height=\"229\">\n          <text id=\"3:112\" name=\"Aggressive Growth\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"132\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:113\" name=\"Projection: $1,590.00 earned in a year on $1,000 Chart labels: Dec ’21 · Mar · Jun · Sep · Dec “The aggressive growth strategy allows you to earn 159% per annum, but with a high risk. Our analysts have balanced the strategy with different assets so that the strategy pays off within the recommended time frame.” Facts (with emoji): 🌱 159% per Year · 🔥 High Risk · 💵 $1,000 minimum · 🗓️ 2 Years · 🧑 1,982 participants\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"160\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:114\" name=\"Share of Assets\" x=\"444\" y=\"486\" width=\"420\" height=\"169\">\n          <text id=\"3:115\" name=\"Share of Assets\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"108\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:116\" name=\"Polygon (MATIC) 50.00% Decentraland (MANA) 25.00% PancakeSwap (CAKE) 12.50% Dogecoin (DOGE) 6.25% Maker (MKR) 6.25%\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"100\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:117\" name=\"Invest &amp; success\" x=\"888\" y=\"486\" width=\"420\" height=\"169\">\n          <text id=\"3:118\" name=\"Invest &amp; success\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"115\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:119\" name=\"Amount 3,021 DAI (balance 3,045.86 DAI; minimum $1,000 met) Button “Hold to Invest” Success: “You’ve invested!” · 3,021.00 DAI · button “View Pocket”\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"100\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:120\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"64\" y=\"3006\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"3:121\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"328\" height=\"36\" />\n      <frame id=\"3:122\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"229\">\n        <frame id=\"3:123\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"229\">\n          <text id=\"3:124\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"103\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"3:125\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand primary color #2B2D33 + Nunito • Media: coin logos, neutral avatar, icons • Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\" x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"596\" height=\"147\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:126\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"229\">\n          <text id=\"3:127\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"197\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"3:128\" name=\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, surfaces, gain / loss, risk levels, accents, chart colors • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: current page, selected tab, pressed, disabled, amount being entered, rising / falling • Headers, page indicator, sheets and all business components • Chart and share-of-assets styling, confetti\" x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"596\" height=\"147\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:129\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"64\" y=\"3335\" width=\"1312\" height=\"291\">\n      <text id=\"3:130\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"3:131\" name=\"Your file is compared with the brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n      <text id=\"3:132\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current page, current coin-list tab, gains vs losses, risk levels, amount being entered)\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1312\" height=\"161\" />\n      <text id=\"3:133\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 5 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"268\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORT