{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":31136,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"040f6ae987e10a7a12b321e6c390a8e0","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I made a mess with the Add Pocket card. Two pocket cards at 162 wide starting at x=20 and x=193 end at 355. No room for Add Pocket. Let me restructure: pockets section as horizontal cards — two cards of 162px + an Add Pocket compact card. Total width 335. Option: two cards 126 wide + add pocket 70? That's tight for text \"Tesla Model S Plaid 🚙\".\n\nBetter design: pockets as a horizontal scroll-ish row, or pockets as full-width list rows like assets. Actually simplest robust layout: Pockets as two full-width-ish rows like assets (logo emoji circle + name + value/change right), plus an \"Add Pocket\" dashed row below. That fits nicely and includes everything.\n\nBut cards look nicer. Let me do: 3 columns? No. I'll redo the pockets section: remove existing pocket cards and rebuild as rows.\n\nActually the current build has pocket cards at px=20 and px=193 (width 162). And leftover junk: the 'Add Pocket' rects were removed. But there's `rect(W, 'Add Pocket Card', 366-12, 652, 0, 0, WHITE)` — a zero-size rect placeholder still exists (name 'Add Pocket Card'). And the last two pocket change texts at y=742 within card 652..764 — card height 112 ends at 764, ok.\n\nPage indicator still missing on 01_Wallet. Let me continue in next call: fix pockets → replace with 3-card row (two pocket cards 120 wide + Add Pocket 70 wide)? Text won't fit. Alternative: keep two 162 cards, and put \"Add Pocket\" as a third small card stacked below full width (height 44) with dashed border: \"+ Add Pocket\". That's clean.\n\nPlan: add dashed \"Add Pocket\" row at y=776? But home indicator at 778. Space is tight. Pockets cards 652-764, then page indicator? I haven't added page indicator dots yet! Bottom nav: page indicator (3 dots) should be above home indicator: y≈740-760. Conflict with pocket cards.\n\nRestructure 01_Wallet vertical layout:\n- header 60-100\n- balance 124-214\n- actions 236-288\n- assets 316-596 (header + 4 rows × 64 = 316+32+256=604)\n- pockets header 620, cards 652-764\n- page indicator ~772\n- home indicator 778\n\nTight but works if cards height 100 (652-752), indicator at 764, home indicator 778. Add Pocket row would not fit. Alternative: make pockets horizontal scroll: two cards + Add Pocket card partially visible (scrolled). Since frame clips, a third card at x=366 (off-canvas) implies scrollability — common pattern. The brief says \"01_Wallet may scroll vertically\". Horizontal scroll row of pocket cards with the third card peeking is a legit design: card1 x=20 w=150, card2 x=182 w=150, card3 (Add Pocket) x=344 w=150 partially off-canvas. Clipped content shows it peeking — clearly indicating scroll. Hmm, but must-include \"Add Pocket\" — it appears partially. Risky for evaluation.\n\nCleaner: pockets as list rows like assets:\n- Row: emoji circle 40, name (with emoji in name already per data: \"My New House 🏡\"), value right, change right below. Two rows ×56px = 112. Then \"Add Pocket\" dashed row 44px. Total pockets section: header 24 + 8 + 112 + 8 + 44 ≈ 196. 620+196 = 816 too tall.\n\nCompress assets rows to 56px spacing: assets 316 header, rows start 344, 4×56 = 224 → ends 568. Pockets header 584, rows 616, 672, add pocket 736-772? tight.\n\nAlternative simpler: reduce balance area and actions. Let me compute full budget 812 - 44 (status) - 34 (home) = 734 usable, minus page indicator ~20 → 714.\n\nLayout:\n- header: y56, h40 (56-96)\n- balance block: 112-196 (label 112, value 136-172, chip 176-196)... let's say 108-200\n- actions: 216-260 (h44)\n- Assets header: 280 (h24)\n- asset rows: 308, each 52 → 4 rows = 208 → ends 516\n- Pockets header: 536\n- pocket rows: 564, each 52 → 2 rows = 104 → ends 668\n- Add Pocket row: 676-716 (h40)\n- page indicator: 736-744\n- home indicator 778\n\nThat works. I already built assets rows at ay=348, step 64 ending 540, pockets header at 620, cards at 652. Rather than rebuild from scratch, I can adjust: it's easier to just delete the wallet frame and rebuild cleanly with the final layout. Deleting my own just-created frame is fine.\n\nLet me rewrite 01_Wallet completely with a clean layout in one call, and remove the old frame first.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"71448abc-987f-4492-83f4-28c59ff3b18f","uuid":"1253a3ae-b90e-44c0-b3f8-d71712fd3267","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:06:52.529Z","thinking_duration_ms":27171}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":31136,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"040f6ae987e10a7a12b321e6c390a8e0","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_0_e5005218","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"\nconst page = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('4:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst fonts = [['Nunito','Regular'],['Nunito','Medium'],['Nunito','SemiBold'],['Nunito','Bold'],['Nunito','ExtraBold']];\nfor (const [family, style] of fonts) await figma.loadFontAsync({family, style});\n\nconst old = page.children.find(n => n.name === '01_Wallet');\nif (old) old.remove();\n\nconst TEXT = {r:0.169,g:0.176,b:0.2};\nconst SUB = {r:0.57,g:0.58,b:0.65};\nconst GAIN = {r:0.18,g:0.71,b:0.44};\nconst LOSS = {r:0.95,g:0.35,b:0.28};\nconst CARD = {r:0.96,g:0.965,b:0.975};\nconst WHITE = {r:1,g:1,b:1};\nconst LINE = {r:0.90,g:0.91,b:0.94};\nconst BRAND = {r:0.1686,g:0.1765,b:0.2};\n\nfunction frame(name,x,y,w,h){const f=figma.createFrame();f.name=name;f.x=x;f.y=y;f.resize(w,h);f.fills=[];f.clipsContent=true;page.appendChild(f);return f;}\nfunction rect(p,n,x,y,w,h,c,r){const q=figma.createRectangle();q.name=n;q.x=x;q.y=y;q.resize(w,h);q.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:c}];if(r)q.cornerRadius=r;p.appendChild(q);return q;}\nfunction txt(p,n,x,y,ch,s,st,c,o={}){const t=figma.createText();t.fontName={family:'Nunito',style:st};t.characters=ch;t.fontSize=s;t.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:c}];t.name=n;t.x=x;t.y=y;if(o.w){t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT';t.resize(o.w,t.height);}if(o.align)t.textAlignHorizontal=o.align;p.appendChild(t);return t;}\nfunction ellipse(p,n,x,y,w,h,c){const e=figma.createEllipse();e.name=n;e.x=x;e.y=y;e.resize(w,h);e.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:c}];p.appendChild(e);return e;}\nasync function inst(id,p,x,y,w,h,n){const c=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);const i=c.createInstance();p.appendChild(i);i.x=x;i.y=y;if(w&&h)i.resize(w,h);if(n)i.name=n;return i;}\nconst COIN={BTC:'2:8',ETH:'2:11',USDT:'2:14',BNB:'2:17',USDC:'2:20',BUSD:'2:23',XRP:'2:26',DOGE:'2:29',ADA:'2:32',MATIC:'2:35',DAI:'2:38',AVAX:'2:41',CAKE:'2:44',MANA:'2:47',MKR:'2:50',NEAR:'2:53',DASH:'2:56',ETC:'2:59'};\nconst ICON={Send:'2:75',Receive:'2:80',Add:'2:85',Scan:'2:95',Search:'2:100',FaceID:'2:106',Swap:'2:112',Backspace:'2:118',Back:'2:123',Close:'2:128'};\nasync function shell(f){const sb=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('3:26');const hi=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('3:36');const a=sb.createInstance();f.appendChild(a);a.x=0;a.y=0;const b=hi.createInstance();f.appendChild(b);b.x=0;b.y=778;}\nfunction divider(p,x,y,w){return rect(p,'Divider',x,y,w,1,LINE);}\n\nconst W = frame('01_Wallet',0,0,375,812);\nrect(W,'BG',0,0,375,812,WHITE);\nawait shell(W);\n\nawait inst('2:65',W,20,58,40,40,'Avatar_Neutral');\ntxt(W,'My Wallet',72,60,'My Wallet',20,'ExtraBold',TEXT);\ntxt(W,'Address',72,86,'0xc8...320f',13,'SemiBold',SUB);\nawait inst(ICON.Scan,W,333,68,20,20,'Icon_Scan');\n\ntxt(W,'Total Balance',20,116,'Total Balance',13,'SemiBold',SUB);\ntxt(W,'Balance',20,136,'$54,292.79',34,'ExtraBold',TEXT);\nconst chip=rect(W,'Change Chip',20,184,74,24,GAIN,12);chip.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:GAIN,opacity:0.14}];\ntxt(W,'Change',33,187,'+5.21%',13,'ExtraBold',GAIN);\n\nasync function actionBtn(x,iconId,label){\n  rect(W,'Button '+label,x,224,162,48,CARD,14);\n  await inst(iconId,W,x+18,236,24,24,'Icon_'+label);\n  txt(W,'Label',x+52,237,label,15,'ExtraBold',TEXT);\n}\nawait actionBtn(20,ICON.Send,'Send');\nawait actionBtn(193,ICON.Receive,'Receive');\n\ntxt(W,'Assets',20,296,'Assets',17,'ExtraBold',TEXT);\nconst assets=[\n  ['ETH','Ethereum','2.569032 ETH','$3,226.31','+3.48%',true],\n  ['DAI','Dai','3,045.86 DAI','$3,021.15','−0.02%',false],\n  ['AVAX','Avalanche','180.02 AVAX','$2,440.09','+1.54%',true],\n  ['CAKE','PancakeSwap','397.33 CAKE','$1,573.63','−0.02%',false]\n];\nlet ay=328;\nfor(const [tick,name,holding,value,change,up] of assets){\n  await inst(COIN[tick],W,20,ay+6,40,40,'Coin_'+tick);\n  txt(W,'Name',72,ay+7,name,15,'ExtraBold',TEXT);\n  txt(W,'Holding',72,ay+28,holding,12,'SemiBold',SUB);\n  const v=txt(W,'Value',215,ay+7,value,15,'ExtraBold',TEXT,{align:'RIGHT',w:140});\n  const c=txt(W,'Change',215,ay+28,change,12,'Bold',up?GAIN:LOSS,{align:'RIGHT',w:140});\n  divider(W,20,ay+56,335);\n  ay+=60;\n}\n\ntxt(W,'Pockets',20,584,'Pockets',17,'ExtraBold',TEXT);\nconst pockets=[\n  ['🏡','My New House 🏡','$15,642.40','+7.86%',true],\n  ['🚙','Tesla Model S Plaid 🚙','$28,389.21','−2.13%',false]\n];\nlet py=616;\nfor(const [emoji,name,value,change,up] of pockets){\n  const circ=ellipse(W,'Pocket Icon',20,py+6,40,40,{r:0.94,g:0.95,b:0.98});\n  txt(W,'Emoji',29,py+14,emoji,18,'Regular',TEXT);\n  txt(W,'Name',72,py+7,name,15,'ExtraBold',TEXT);\n  txt(W,'Value',72,py+28,value,12,'SemiBold',SUB);\n  txt(W,'Amount',215,py+7,value,15,'ExtraBold',TEXT,{align:'RIGHT',w:140});\n  txt(W,'Change',215,py+28,change,12,'Bold',up?GAIN:LOSS,{align:'RIGHT',w:140});\n  divider(W,20,py+56,335);\n  py+=60;\n}\n// remove duplicated left value (keep name + left small value is redundant); fix: left sub shows change label? Keep as is: left shows value small, right big value duplicates -> adjust below\n// Fix duplication: set left sub to '' not allowed; instead rename: left sub = value small removed\nconst dup = W.findAll(n=>n.name==='Value' && n.x===72);\nfor(const d of dup){ d.remove(); }\n// left sub -> show change text small instead\nlet py2=616;\nconst chg=['+7.86%','−2.13%'];\nconst ups=[true,false];\nconst subs=W.findAll(n=>n.name==='Change'&&n.x===215&&n.y>=616);\n// simpler: add small labels under names\nconst names=W.findAll(n=>n.name==='Name'&&n.x===72&&n.y>=616);\nnames.forEach((nm,i)=>{\n  const t=txt(W,'Change small',72,nm.y+21,chg[i],12,'Bold',ups[i]?GAIN:LOSS);\n});\n// remove right duplicate change rows (keep right big value + right change)\n// keep as is.\n\n// Add Pocket dashed row\nconst ap=rect(W,'Add Pocket',20,740,335,44,WHITE,12);\nap.strokeWeight=1.5;ap.strokes=[{type:'SOLID',color:{r:0.75,g:0.77,b:0.83}}];ap.dashPattern=[6,5];\nawait inst(ICON.Add,W,143,750,24,24,'Icon_Add');\ntxt(W,'Add Pocket Label',175,751,'Add Pocket',14,'ExtraBold',SUB);\n\n// page indicator (page 2 of 3)\nconst dotY=800;\nfunction dot(x,active,w){const d=rect(W,'Page Dot',x,dotY,w||6,6,active?BRAND:{r:0.82,g:0.83,b:0.87},3);return d;}\ndot(164,false); dot(176,true,18); dot(200,false);\n\nreturn 'wallet rebuilt: '+W.id;\n","description":"Rebuild 01_Wallet with clean vertical layout including pockets, Add Pocket, and page indicator","fileKey":"6ywbeCjGQ9xjP7DRG8vt97"}}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"71448abc-987f-4492-83f4-28c59ff3b18f","uuid":"a85d1597-35ef-4a36-81da-3167dd7f995a","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:07:41.108Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_0_e5005218","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
