{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":44995,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"02036ae989a40a7ac2b2c659b003ae7b","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now build 03_Strategy sheet. Steps:\n\n- Frame 03_Strategy at (920,0), 375×812, white bg, status bar, home indicator.\n- Scrim over full frame (black 0.5).\n- Sheet: frame at y≈40, w375, h~1200 content, top corners rounded 24, clipsContent false, overflowDirection VERTICAL.\n- Content inside sheet:\n  - Grabber + dismiss (close icon top-right).\n  - Title \"Aggressive Growth\" 24 ExtraBold + risk chip \"🔥 High Risk\" red-tint.\n  - Fact tiles (2 cols, each ~162×64, CARD bg radius 14): \"🌱 159% per Year / Interest Income\", \"🔥 High Risk / Level of risk\", \"💵 $1,000 / Minimum investment amount\", \"🗓️ 2 Years / Recommended investment period\", \"🧑 1,982 / Participants\".\n  - Projection card: chart. Chart: polyline growing from Dec'21 to Dec. Draw with vector: create VECTOR with vectorPaths. Simpler: use figma.createVector() and set vectorPaths with an SVG-like path 'M x y L ...'. Chart area 343×160, labels below: Dec '21 · Mar · Jun · Sep · Dec.\n    - \"$1,590.00\" big + caption text.\n    - Chart line green.\n  - About Strategy: heading + description text (long).\n  - Share of Assets: 5 rows: logo, name (ticker), share %; maybe with a thin progress bar under each showing share. Bar width proportional.\n  - Invest button (instance of 3:19) pinned at bottom of sheet viewport — but sheet scrolls; Invest pinned: put Invest button NOT in scroll content but fixed on sheet at y = 812-40-34-... hmm sheet top at 40, bottom at 778 (home indicator). If content scrolls within sheet frame with clipsContent true, pinned button: place button as sibling of scroll content inside sheet? A scrolling frame clips children; pinned element must be outside the scrolling frame. Structure: Sheet frame (fixed, clips) containing: ScrollContent (scrollable, 375×738) + InvestBar (fixed at bottom y=670) overlapping. But overlap inside same parent — children all scroll together? Only frames with overflowDirection scroll; other siblings stay. But the scroll content would render behind the Invest bar (fine, bar has bg).\n\nActually simpler: Sheet frame (375×772 at y=40, radius 24, clips true, white). Inside: Content frame (scrollable, 375×772, overflow VERTICAL, content height ~1150). Invest bar placed inside Sheet at bottom (y=690, height 82) with white bg — but it's a sibling of Content inside Sheet, so it won't scroll. But Content is 772 tall and will render its scrolled content behind the bar — the bar bg white covers it. \n\nSheet height: from y=40 to 778 = 738. Invest bar at y = 738-92 = 646 within sheet. Content frame height 738.\n\nChart vector: create vector with vectorPaths:\n```\nconst v = figma.createVector();\nv.vectorPaths = [{windingRule:'NONE', data:'M 0 120 L 60 100 L 120 108 L 180 70 L 240 78 L 311 10'}];\nv.strokeWeight = 2.5; v.strokes = [green]; v.fills = [];\n```\nArea fill under chart: skip or add a second vector with fill and low opacity: path closed: 'M 0 120 L ... L 311 130 L 0 130 Z' with green 0.12 fill, no stroke.\n\nShare bars: for each asset row, a background track (335×4, CARD) + filled portion (share% × 335, brand/green). Actually 50% etc.\n\nRow: logo 32, name+Ticker left, share right, bar below spanning full width. Height ~52 each.\n\nLet me write 03_Strategy now.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"71448abc-987f-4492-83f4-28c59ff3b18f","uuid":"0490acf6-81fc-404a-9d4b-d216f6ed1c7b","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:14:10.959Z","thinking_duration_ms":24227}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":44995,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"02036ae989a40a7ac2b2c659b003ae7b","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_0_0c3ce571","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"\nconst page = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('4:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nfor (const style of ['Regular','Medium','SemiBold','Bold','ExtraBold']) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Nunito',style});\n\nconst TEXT={r:0.169,g:0.176,b:0.2}, SUB={r:0.57,g:0.58,b:0.65}, GAIN={r:0.18,g:0.71,b:0.44}, LOSS={r:0.95,g:0.35,b:0.28}, CARD={r:0.96,g:0.965,b:0.975}, WHITE={r:1,g:1,b:1}, LINE={r:0.90,g:0.91,b:0.94}, BRAND={r:0.1686,g:0.1765,b:0.2};\n\nconst old=page.children.find(n=>n.name==='03_Strategy'); if(old) old.remove();\n\nfunction frame(p,name,x,y,w,h){const f=figma.createFrame();f.name=name;f.x=x;f.y=y;f.resize(w,h);f.fills=[];f.clipsContent=true;(p||page).appendChild(f);return f;}\nfunction rect(p,n,x,y,w,h,c,r){const q=figma.createRectangle();q.name=n;q.x=x;q.y=y;q.resize(w,h);q.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:c}];if(r)q.cornerRadius=r;p.appendChild(q);return q;}\nfunction txt(p,n,x,y,ch,s,st,c,o={}){const t=figma.createText();t.fontName={family:'Nunito',style:st};t.characters=ch;t.fontSize=s;t.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:c}];t.name=n;t.x=x;t.y=y;if(o.w){t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT';t.resize(o.w,t.height);}if(o.align)t.textAlignHorizontal=o.align;p.appendChild(t);return t;}\nasync function inst(id,p,x,y,w,h,n){const c=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);const i=c.createInstance();p.appendChild(i);i.x=x;i.y=y;if(w&&h)i.resize(w,h);if(n)i.name=n;return i;}\nconst COIN={MATIC:'2:35',MANA:'2:47',CAKE:'2:44',DOGE:'2:29',MKR:'2:50',DAI:'2:38'};\n\nconst S = frame(null,'03_Strategy',920,0,375,812);\nrect(S,'BG',0,0,375,812,WHITE);\nconst sb=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('3:26');const sbi=sb.createInstance();S.appendChild(sbi);sbi.x=0;sbi.y=0;\nconst hi=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('3:36');const hii=hi.createInstance();S.appendChild(hii);hii.x=0;hii.y=778;\nrect(S,'Scrim',0,0,375,812,{r:0.1,g:0.1,b:0.13}).fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:{r:0.1,g:0.1,b:0.13},opacity:0.45}];\n\nconst Sheet = frame(S,'Sheet',0,40,375,772);\nSheet.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:WHITE}];\nSheet.topLeftRadius=24;Sheet.topRightRadius=24;\nrect(Sheet,'Grabber',168,10,40,5,{r:0.85,g:0.86,b:0.89},3);\nconst closeBg=rect(Sheet,'Dismiss',329,24,32,32,CARD,16);\nawait inst('2:128',Sheet,335,30,20,20,'Icon_Close');\n\nconst C = frame(Sheet,'Content',0,24,375,748);\nC.clipsContent=false;C.fills=[];\nSheet.overflowDirection='VERTICAL';\n// move grabber & dismiss above content visually: reorder later\n\ntxt(C,'Title',24,32,'Aggressive Growth',24,'ExtraBold',TEXT);\nconst riskT=txt(C,'Risk Label',0,0,'🔥 High Risk',12,'ExtraBold',LOSS);\nconst riskChip=rect(C,'Risk Chip',24,72,riskT.width+24,28,{r:1,g:0.92,b:0.90},14);\nriskT.x=36;riskT.y=78;\n\n// facts grid\nconst facts=[\n  ['🌱','159% per Year','Interest Income'],\n  ['🔥','High Risk','Level of risk'],\n  ['💵','$1,000','Minimum investment amount'],\n  ['🗓️','2 Years','Recommended investment period'],\n  ['🧑','1,982','Participants']\n];\nlet fx=24,fy=116;\nfor(let i=0;i<facts.length;i++){\n  const [emoji,value,label]=facts[i];\n  rect(C,'Fact Card',fx,fy,158,66,CARD,14);\n  txt(C,'Emoji',fx+12,fy+10,emoji,14,'Regular',TEXT);\n  txt(C,'Value',fx+34,fy+10,value,15,'ExtraBold',TEXT);\n  txt(C,'Label',fx+12,fy+36,label,10.5,'Bold',SUB,{w:134});\n  if(i%2===1){fx=24;fy+=76;}else{fx=193;}\n}\nfy+=76; // after 5th card (odd count: last row single)\n\n// projection card\nconst cardY=fy+12;\nconst pc=rect(C,'Projection Card',24,cardY,327,250,WHITE,16);\npc.strokes=[{type:'SOLID',color:LINE}];pc.strokeWeight=1;\ntxt(C,'Earn',40,cardY+16,'$1,590.00',24,'ExtraBold',GAIN);\ntxt(C,'Caption',40,cardY+48,'This is how much you can earn in a year if you invest $1,000 to “Aggressive Growth”',11.5,'SemiBold',SUB,{w:295});\n\n// chart\nconst chartTop=cardY+96, chartH=90, chartW=295, chartX=40;\nconst pts=[[0,72],[59,58],[118,64],[177,36],[236,42],[295,6]];\nlet d='M '+pts.map(p=>p[0]+' '+(chartTop+p[1])).join(' L ');\nconst line=figma.createVector();\nline.name='Growth Chart';\nline.vectorPaths=[{windingRule:'NONE',data:d}];\nline.strokeWeight=2.5;line.strokes=[{type:'SOLID',color:GAIN}];line.fills=[];line.strokeCap='ROUND';line.strokeJoin='ROUND';\nline.x=chartX;line.y=chartTop;line.resize(chartW,chartH);\nC.appendChild(line);\nconst area=figma.createVector();\narea.name='Chart Fill';\narea.vectorPaths=[{windingRule:'NONZERO',data:d+' L 295 '+(chartTop+90)+' L 0 '+(chartTop+90)+' Z'}];\narea.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:GAIN,opacity:0.10}];area.strokes=[];\narea.x=chartX;area.y=chartTop;area.resize(chartW,chartH);\nC.appendChild(area);\n// x labels\nconst months=['Dec ’21','Mar','Jun','Sep','Dec'];\nlet mx=chartX;\nmonths.forEach((m,i)=>{\n  const t=txt(C,'Month',0,0,m,10,'Bold',SUB);\n  if(i===0)t.x=chartX;\n  else if(i===months.length-1)t.x=chartX+chartW-t.width;\n  else t.x=chartX+(chartW/(months.length-1))*i-t.width/2;\n  t.y=chartTop+chartH+8;\n});\n\n// About\nconst aboutY=cardY+266;\ntxt(C,'About Strategy',24,aboutY,'About Strategy',17,'ExtraBold',TEXT);\ntxt(C,'Description',24,aboutY+30,'The aggressive growth strategy allows you to earn 159% per annum, but with a high risk. Our analysts have balanced the strategy with different assets so that the strategy pays off within the recommended time frame.',13,'Medium',SUB,{w:327});\n\n// Share of Assets\nconst shareY=aboutY+30+90+24;\ntxt(C,'Share of Assets',24,shareY,'Share of Assets',17,'ExtraBold',TEXT);\nconst shares=[\n  ['MATIC','Polygon','MATIC','50.00%'],\n  ['MANA','Decentraland','MANA','25.00%'],\n  ['CAKE','PancakeSwap','CAKE','12.50%'],\n  ['DOGE','Dogecoin','DOGE','6.25%'],\n  ['MKR','Maker','MKR','6.25%']\n];\nlet sy=shareY+34;\nfor(const [logo,name,tick,share] of shares){\n  await inst(COIN[logo],C,24,sy,32,32,'Coin_'+logo);\n  txt(C,'Name',68,sy+1,name,14,'ExtraBold',TEXT);\n  txt(C,'Ticker',68,sy+20,tick,11,'SemiBold',SUB);\n  txt(C,'Share',251,sy+8,share,14,'ExtraBold',TEXT,{align:'RIGHT',w:100});\n  rect(C,'Bar Track',24,sy+40,327,4,CARD,2);\n  rect(C,'Bar Fill',24,sy+40,327*parseFloat(share)/100,4,BRAND,2);\n  sy+=56;\n}\n\n// bottom spacer so content scrolls above pinned invest bar\nrect(C,'Spacer',24,sy+8,327,120,WHITE);\n\n// pinned invest bar\nconst bar=rect(Sheet,'Invest Bar',0,668,375,104,WHITE);\nbar.strokes=[{type:'SOLID',color:LINE}];bar.strokeWeight=1;bar.strokeAlign='INSIDE';\nconst btn=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('3:19');\nconst bi=btn.createInstance();Sheet.appendChild(bi);bi.x=20;bi.y=694;bi.resize(335,52);\n\n// ensure grabber & dismiss on top of scroll content\nSheet.appendChild(Sheet.findOne(n=>n.name==='Grabber'));\nSheet.appendChild(Sheet.findOne(n=>n.name==='Dismiss'));\nSheet.appendChild(Sheet.findOne(n=>n.name==='Icon_Close'));\n\nreturn 'strategy done: '+S.id;\n","description":"Build 03_Strategy bottom sheet with facts, projection chart, about, share of assets and pinned Invest button","fileKey":"6ywbeCjGQ9xjP7DRG8vt97"}}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"71448abc-987f-4492-83f4-28c59ff3b18f","uuid":"6b6365cf-c273-45b2-8a95-1730896f3041","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:15:12.126Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_0_0c3ce571","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
