ng entered\". Also the swap currency chip next to DAI.\n\nDesign:\n- Sheet y=64, rounded top 24.\n- Row y=84: back circle button (Icon_Back) left at x=20; centered title \"Invest to Strategy\" 17 ExtraBold.\n- y=150: amount center: \"3,021\" 40 ExtraBold + cursor; below: currency chip centered: Coin_DAI 20 + \"DAI\" + Icon_Swap 16. y=200.\n- y=236: row: \"Balance: 3,045.86 DAI\" left + \"Max\" pill right. (Max action)\n- y=268: \"⛽️ No gas, free investments\" centered, 12 SemiBold SUB.\n- keypad y=310..310+4*62=558.\n- Hold to Invest button y=574 height 56: dark rounded 18, FaceID icon white + \"Hold to Invest\" white. FaceID icon vectors: need white fill override — instance of 2:106 has vectors without fills? Earlier info: Icon_Face_ID children vectors had no fills listed (2:104, 2:105 without fills property shown). Might inherit or be dark. I can set fills on instance children via overrides (allowed: fills override on instance children is allowed). I'll set vector fills to white.\n\nHome indicator at 778 — overlaps button? Button ends 630. OK.\n\nKeypad keys: each key: number 24 Medium + letters 10 SemiBold SUB. For \",\" and \"0\" single. Backspace icon key.\n\nSheet over 02_Discovery: presentation note satisfied by scrim.\n\nThen 05_Invest_Success:\n- Presentation: sheet over 02_Discovery\n- Actions: close, View Pocket\n- Celebration: 🎉 and confetti\n- Copy: \"You've invested!\" · \"3,021.00 DAI in the \"Aggressive Growth\" strategy. You will find the purchased coins in a new pocket.\"\n\nLayout: scrim + sheet maybe centered modal or bottom sheet ~half height. Bottom sheet from y~330 to 812? Or full sheet. Design: bottom sheet rounded top, height ~480 from y=332.\n- close icon top-right (or grabber + close)\n- 🎉 emoji large center + confetti pieces (colored rects rotated) around\n- Title \"You've invested!\" 22 ExtraBold center\n- Body text center\n- View Pocket button (primary) y bottom.\n\nConfetti: scatter ~12 small rotated rects/circles in brand colors (gain